format gbcli-pixels 1
# Slinky: one piece, a short coil stack, used twice (data/toys.txt says
# `same`, so the half B frame is unused); two of them make the finished
# slinky, one full, tall stack (Ben's art review, 2026-11-16).
# Three 16x16 frames. Pieces are objects too, so no dark gray: clear shows
# the belt behind them (tools/tiles.py).
size 48 16
color . clear
color w #ffffff
color l #aaaaaa
color k #000000
fill .

rows 0 0    # the short coil stack (both halves), about half the height
